;; M1e2 S1e2.1a.5: a query's `:over` names which states of R it asks about —
;; `all` (the default), `minimal` or `maximal`, and nothing else. A component,
;; or any other subset, is not a value (`region_language.md` § 9, question 6).

(relation p Thing Place)
(p A H1)
(query :goal (p A ?h) :over best :expect (model (p A H1)))
